#
# File: module/Application/view/application/destinations/peru.phtml, line: 50
msgid "Embark on a journey to Peru, a land where the echoes of ancient civilizations blend seamlessly with the rhythm of modern life. Peru is not just a destination; it's an experience that will stir your soul and ignite your imagination. Whether you're trekking the Inca Trail, sandboarding in Huacachina, or marveling at the Nazca Lines, Peru promises an adventure that you'll never forget."
msgstr ""
#
# File: module/Application/view/application/destinations/peru.phtml, line: 105
msgid "Peru is one of the world's most varied countries. It is a multicultural nation, filled with traditions, a unique gastronomy and vast natural reserves."
msgstr ""
#
# File: module/Application/view/application/destinations/peru.phtml, line: 115
msgid "Discover the Wonders of Peru"
msgstr ""
#
# File: module/Application/view/application/destinations/peru.phtml, line: 116
msgid "Peru is a country of breathtaking landscapes, rich cultural heritage, and world-renowned cuisine. From the ancient ruins of Machu Picchu to the vibrant streets of Lima, there's something for every traveler. Explore the Amazon rainforest, trek through the Andes, and immerse yourself in the local traditions that make Peru a unique and unforgettable destination."
msgstr ""
#
